, and sensing solutions for critical environments, as well as sensing products encompassing liquid level, flow, and pressure sensors, motion sensors and components, and hygienic sensors. This segment markets its products under the QUALITROL, GEMS SENSORS, SETRA SYSTEMS, HENGSTLER DYNAPAR, ANDERSON-NEGELE, DOVER MOTION, SPECIALTY PRODUCT TECHNOLOGIES, and PACIFIC SCIENTIFIC ENERGETIC MATERIALS COMPANY. It serves semiconductor, diversified electronics, communications, utilities, defense and space, industrial manufacturing, and other industries. The company was formerly known as New Precision Technologies Company. Ralliant Corporation was incorporated in 2024 and is based in Raleigh, North Carolina."}}